    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tropicalypse</strong> is an innovative third- and first-person zombie shooter game set in a lush tropical apocalypse. Featuring a dynamic, changeable story, players can shape the fate of the world as they face hordes of the undead in an immersive survival adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is more than just a game; it\u2019s a lifelong skill-testing journey. As the developer, I\u2019ve committed to continually updating and improving Tropicalypse with new features, mechanics, and content, making it a constantly evolving experience. Whether you're exploring the tropical wasteland or fighting for survival, Tropicalypse will grow alongside my passion and skills for game development.</p>",
